    "Reduce forecast overshoot after sharp price spikes by applying a 10-15% dampening factor.",
    "Apply mean reversion bias: if forecast is > 5% above recent 7-day average, reduce by 1-2% per day.",
    "Increase forecast sensitivity to sentiment when price is near support levels (e.g., 5% below recent low)."
